<h3>Version 1.0.9</h3>
<ul>
  <li>Two Macs signed in to the same account now stay in sync: files stored,
      moved or deleted on one appear, move and disappear on the other within
      seconds — in the right folders.</li>
  <li>Files sent from your phone or another device now land in the folder
      they were addressed to, not in the generic Documents pile.</li>
  <li>Changes made while a Mac was asleep catch up automatically when it
      reconnects.</li>
</ul>
]]></description>
