            <description><![CDATA[<style>
  body { font: 13px -apple-system, system-ui, sans-serif; color: #1d1d1f; margin: 0; }
  h3 { font-size: 14px; margin: 0 0 8px; }
  ul { margin: 0; padding-left: 18px; }
  li { margin-bottom: 6px; }
</style>
<h3>Version 1.0.8</h3>
<ul>
  <li>Setting up no longer asks for Telegram app keys — they come with the app.
      A new Mac goes straight to the phone number.</li>
  <li>Fixed: when many files were copied in at once, roughly one in a hundred
      was reported as failed although it had in fact reached Telegram.</li>
  <li>If Telegram ever refuses the built-in keys, you can enter your own —
      the app explains where to get them and what they are.</li>
</ul>
]]></description>
