<h3>Version 1.0.7</h3>
<ul>
  <li>Fixed a memory leak that showed up when importing large libraries —
      memory now stays flat instead of growing with every file.</li>
  <li>Uploading a few thousand files no longer slows down as it goes.</li>
  <li>The diagnostics report can now include a memory breakdown.</li>
</ul>
]]></description>
